LOCATION:Catalina Jazz Club\, Hollywood
DESCRIPTION:On Wednesday\, October 28th\, join GRAMMY©-nominated TV and Br
 
oadway star Ilene Graff on a journey through her life\, celebrating the peo
 
ple\, events\, and places that have brought her great joy\, meaning\, comfo
 
rt\, and gratitude. Singing a wide range of her favorite musical genres (an
 
d some special surprises!)\, Ilene shares her love and appreciation of life
 
 through music. With musical direction by Sam Kriger\, "Travelin' Thru" is 
 
a concert that will make you laugh\, feel deeply and be reminded that even 
 
when times are tough\, there's so much to be thankful for. Catalina Jazz Cl
 
ub 6725 West Sunset Blvd. Hollywood\, CA 90028 *Tickets purchased online re
 
ceive priority seating. *Single Entree or Drink minimums apply for all tick
 
ets ILENE GRAFF TRAVELIN' THRU A ROAD MAP OF GRATITUDE Tickets & info: http
 
